    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Current Module 1-only export of the tested final Assignment 03 collection. All setup/intermediate requests in the B1 folder are retained. Synthetic data; Telegram intentionally disabled in this collection; real receipt is a separate manual gate. Original full A1/A2, B1/B2 and C1/C2 collections remain unchanged."
